1
00:01:32,450 --> 00:01:35,039
[Forging Justice]

2
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:37,680
[Episode 31]

3
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,330
The report shows

4
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:44,000
that the bloodstains on the shirt

5
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:44,930
were tested to be

6
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,280
blood types O,

7
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,039
A,

8
00:01:47,310 --> 00:01:47,920
and A.

9
00:01:48,759 --> 00:01:49,920
While the defendant,

10
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:50,950
the defendant's brother,

11
00:01:50,950 --> 00:01:52,280
and the defendant's father

12
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,210
have blood types

13
00:01:53,479 --> 00:01:55,200
A, O, and A.

14
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,860
The victim, Yin Ping's blood type

15
00:01:57,870 --> 00:01:58,590
is also A.

16
00:01:59,229 --> 00:01:59,890
Therefore,

17
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:01,760
we cannot rule out that

18
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:03,310
these bloodstains belong to Yin Ping.

19
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:04,790
So it doesn't prove

20
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,070
that the bloodstains on the shirt

21
00:02:06,070 --> 00:02:06,930
are Yin Ping's.

22
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,160
Right?

23
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,590
Blood type can only rule people out,

24
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:11,790
not identify anyone.

25
00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:12,680
I would like to ask,

26
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,430
why wasn't

27
00:02:13,450 --> 00:02:14,910
a more detailed blood test

28
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:16,120
or DNA test done?

29
00:02:16,230 --> 00:02:17,079
The victim's blood sample

30
00:02:17,079 --> 00:02:18,079
we currently have

31
00:02:18,270 --> 00:02:19,120
can no longer meet

32
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,960
the technical requirements for re-testing.

33
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,900
Presiding Judge,

34
00:02:21,900 --> 00:02:22,800
the defender requests

35
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,079
a new examination

36
00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:25,900
of the bloodstains on the shirt.

37
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:34,430
Prosecutor, you just said

38
00:02:34,430 --> 00:02:36,079
the existing blood sample of the victim

39
00:02:36,079 --> 00:02:36,770
cannot meet

40
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,579
the technical requirements for re-testing.

41
00:02:38,579 --> 00:02:39,410
Does that include

42
00:02:39,410 --> 00:02:40,310
DNA testing?

43
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:41,079
Yes.

44
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,600
We consulted institutions in Beijing.

45
00:02:43,960 --> 00:02:45,760
What if retesting is necessary?

46
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:47,590
Then we might have to exhume the body.

47
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:49,590
The victim has already been buried.

48
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,710
If the DNA from

49
00:02:51,730 --> 00:02:52,340
the shirt

50
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:54,490
turns out not to match the victim—

51
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,770
meaning it's not Yin Ping's blood—

52
00:02:57,030 --> 00:02:58,520
that would be enough to prove

53
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,450
the defendant is not the murderer.

54
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:02,090
But what if—

55
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:03,980
what if there's another oversight,

56
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:05,030
another mistake?

57
00:03:05,450 --> 00:03:07,710
Now you don't care about being rigorous?

58
00:03:15,030 --> 00:03:15,690
Where is it?

59
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:32,100
[Intensive Care Unit]

60
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:39,079
Qiuyue.

61
00:03:42,630 --> 00:03:43,840
I'm sorry.

62
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:50,960
I'm sorry.

63
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,080
The victim

64
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:03,150
suffered a total of 14

65
00:04:03,560 --> 00:04:04,820
sharp force injuries.

66
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,240
Thirteen of them

67
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,310
are on the right side of his abdomen.

68
00:04:08,310 --> 00:04:10,030
Another one is on the victim's

69
00:04:10,190 --> 00:04:11,280
left lower back.

70
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,470
Every stab went deep into internal organs.

71
00:04:13,470 --> 00:04:14,400
This shows

72
00:04:14,530 --> 00:04:16,000
the murderer is a repeat offender

73
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,630
who is skilled with blades.

74
00:04:18,190 --> 00:04:19,310
And there is a high probability

75
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:20,839
that they are left-handed.

76
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:23,210
The first strike went in

77
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,570
from behind the victim.

78
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,480
This clearly indicates

79
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,070
a premeditated crime,

80
00:04:27,190 --> 00:04:29,240
not a spur-of-the-moment drunken act

81
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,770
as the prosecution claims.

82
00:04:30,870 --> 00:04:31,800
None of these characteristics

83
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,000
match the defendant.

84
00:04:40,159 --> 00:04:41,690
Let me remind the defender—

85
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:42,870
in this courtroom,

86
00:04:42,870 --> 00:04:44,310
only admitted evidence

87
00:04:44,310 --> 00:04:45,440
counts as evidence.

88
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:47,480
Everything you just said

89
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,560
is either logical inference

90
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,950
or subjective speculation.

91
00:04:49,950 --> 00:04:52,000
Or, shall I say,
a challenge to the coroner

92
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,270
and the professional lab's

93
00:04:53,270 --> 00:04:54,400
evaluation report.

94
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,360
What?

95
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:03,870
I know

96
00:05:03,870 --> 00:05:05,480
Yu Gaoyuan is usually a jerk,

97
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,160
but this time he went too far.

98
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,190
We were this close

99
00:05:08,190 --> 00:05:09,720
to convicting Lin Huaimin,

100
00:05:09,730 --> 00:05:10,920
and he had to butt in.

101
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,000
The judge was right to do that.

102
00:05:14,270 --> 00:05:15,730
Fairness isn't a mistake.

103
00:05:16,270 --> 00:05:17,730
How can you be so detached?

104
00:05:18,380 --> 00:05:18,980
What we had

105
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,070
wasn't direct evidence anyway.

106
00:05:20,070 --> 00:05:20,870
It's useless.

107
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:22,330
Can you prove that

108
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,240
when Hu Xudong committed the crime,

109
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,160
he was wearing a suit?

110
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,190
You can't prove it.

111
00:05:25,190 --> 00:05:26,390
I'm not on your level.

112
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:33,830
Honey.

113
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,950
Yes, I...

114
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:38,520
I know it's the baby's 100th day today.

115
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,510
Yizhong and I

116
00:05:40,530 --> 00:05:42,330
are going over today's hearing.

117
00:05:43,300 --> 00:05:44,430
Wait till I get back.

118
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,620
Just watch how I do.

119
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:46,830
I'll make it up to you.

120
00:05:47,590 --> 00:05:48,070
Okay.

121
00:05:49,630 --> 00:05:50,830
The baby's 100th day?

122
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:53,190
She's mad, huh?

123
00:05:53,190 --> 00:05:53,990
Chewed me out.

124
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:56,560
Haven't you ever seen

125
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,260
my daughter?

126
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:57,740
No.

127
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,360
See?

128
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,390
We're busy with this crap all day.

129
00:06:00,390 --> 00:06:01,250
Let me show you.

130
00:06:06,510 --> 00:06:07,040
So chubby.

131
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,700
Almost seven pounds at birth.

132
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,900
Her eyes are like your wife's.

133
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:11,770
Good, better hers than mine.

134
00:06:11,770 --> 00:06:12,970
My eyes are too small.

135
00:06:20,390 --> 00:06:21,680
What a small world.

136
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,200
Everyone's eating here.

137
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,950
I thought this would go smoothly,

138
00:06:24,950 --> 00:06:26,430
but now it's a complete mess.

139
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:27,190
We've come this far.

140
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:28,320
Don't overthink it.

141
00:06:29,430 --> 00:06:31,240
If I were you,
I'd pretend I don't know anyone

142
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,190
and just go for the jugular.

143
00:06:32,190 --> 00:06:33,600
That's exactly what I want to do.

144
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,000
But now,

145
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,330
how am I going to do that?

146
00:06:36,070 --> 00:06:37,190
Even Chen Yizhong couldn't find any

147
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:37,950
conclusive evidence.

148
00:06:37,950 --> 00:06:39,240
We were just stuck
looking awkward in court.

149
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:40,120
What else can we say?

150
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:40,909
Nothing.

151
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:45,750
Eat up.

152
00:06:47,310 --> 00:06:49,190
I... I'll go say hi to them.

153
00:06:49,830 --> 00:06:51,360
Why are you going there now?

154
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,760
Don't cause trouble.

155
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:54,240
This is against the rules.

156
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:56,040
What are you afraid of?
We're all old classmates.

157
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,130
-Don't make trouble.
-Enough.

158
00:06:57,130 --> 00:06:57,990
Just stay here.

159
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,750
Go. Go, go.

160
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:07,950
I know the rules.

161
00:07:08,070 --> 00:07:08,270
Hey.

162
00:07:08,270 --> 00:07:10,040
How can you be so bold?

163
00:07:11,830 --> 00:07:13,190
Today is my daughter's 100th day.

164
00:07:13,190 --> 00:07:15,040
One drink's no big deal, right?

165
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,310
Didn't we agree on that?

166
00:07:17,310 --> 00:07:18,040
Keep it down.

167
00:07:18,190 --> 00:07:19,680
Godfather, godmother.

168
00:07:20,310 --> 00:07:22,430
There's another godfather over there.

169
00:07:22,430 --> 00:07:24,630
You haven't seen my daughter, have you?

170
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,360
Let me show you.

171
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:27,000
My chubby daughter.

172
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:27,660
Take a look.

173
00:07:29,190 --> 00:07:29,750
Isn't she great?

174
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:30,390
So cute.

175
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,360
Show him.

176
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:36,920
Come on.

177
00:07:38,430 --> 00:07:39,310
No more drinking.

178
00:07:39,310 --> 00:07:40,080
That won't do.

179
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,430
Just finish the last bit.

180
00:07:41,430 --> 00:07:42,159
Have a drink.

181
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:53,760
Get back there.

182
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:56,120
You... Today...

183
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,580
You were really annoying.

184
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,650
I'm leaving.

185
00:08:20,070 --> 00:08:21,200
Has your supervisor

186
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,180
read this article?

187
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:26,170
I briefly told him about it.

188
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:27,870
He takes it seriously and supports it,

189
00:08:27,870 --> 00:08:29,130
but he hasn't read the article yet.

190
00:08:29,130 --> 00:08:30,530
You are the first reader.

191
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:32,130
Then,

192
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:33,870
written this way,

193
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,090
can it be published?

194
00:08:35,549 --> 00:08:36,610
My mentor once said

195
00:08:36,789 --> 00:08:38,480
we must trust that
this country and its people

196
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:40,240
have a deep love for fairness and justice.

197
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,440
There may be detours,

198
00:08:41,750 --> 00:08:43,679
but we'll always find our way back.

199
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:49,390
This article is really well written.

200
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:50,480
If I saw it

201
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,340
at a newsstand,

202
00:08:51,410 --> 00:08:52,720
I would definitely buy extra copies

203
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,920
to give to my friends.

204
00:08:54,750 --> 00:08:56,960
I'm sure many other media outlets

205
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:57,820
will pick it up,

206
00:08:58,030 --> 00:08:59,360
even central media.

207
00:09:01,390 --> 00:09:01,870
I...

208
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:04,460
Can I make two small suggestions?

209
00:09:04,630 --> 00:09:05,160
Go ahead.

210
00:09:05,630 --> 00:09:06,720
I noticed my husband

211
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:08,000
is mentioned here.

212
00:09:10,670 --> 00:09:11,800
Only one short line.

213
00:09:12,790 --> 00:09:14,450
Can you not mention him at all?

214
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:15,870
Sure.

215
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:17,960
Thank you.

216
00:09:18,390 --> 00:09:18,960
Also,

217
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:21,390
the part about Yan Jicai's daughter,

218
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:22,390
can you delete it?

219
00:09:25,030 --> 00:09:26,560
I understand your concern.

220
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:29,360
But this girl

221
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,640
really helps draw out

222
00:09:30,670 --> 00:09:32,150
the reader's sympathy.

223
00:09:32,630 --> 00:09:33,890
Would you reconsider?

224
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,510
I still hope to protect

225
00:09:38,510 --> 00:09:39,200
his family.

226
00:09:39,910 --> 00:09:40,670
If this report

227
00:09:40,670 --> 00:09:41,470
is published,

228
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:43,140
his wife's livelihood

229
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,300
might be disrupted

230
00:09:44,910 --> 00:09:45,970
or even destroyed.

231
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,290
And his daughter

232
00:09:47,290 --> 00:09:48,360
might be called

233
00:09:48,390 --> 00:09:50,390
a rapist's daughter at school.

234
00:09:51,430 --> 00:09:53,630
I would feel terrible if that happened.

235
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:57,840
Right.

236
00:09:58,430 --> 00:10:00,330
Public sympathy comes easy,

237
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:01,360
but it fades fast.

238
00:10:01,670 --> 00:10:02,400
Unreliable.

239
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,150
Okay, I agree.

240
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,320
I also believe that rationality

241
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,360
and deep thinking

242
00:10:12,390 --> 00:10:13,460
are the real purposes

243
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:14,320
of this report.

244
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,370
Any other comments?

245
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,820
When will it be published?

246
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:20,400
Very soon, barring issues.

247
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,320
Maybe one morning,

248
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:23,150
you'll step outside

249
00:10:23,150 --> 00:10:24,840
and find everything has changed.

250
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,500
That's the power of the press.

251
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,260
Right, the power of the press.

252
00:10:29,390 --> 00:10:30,250
That's it then.

253
00:10:30,790 --> 00:10:31,240
Okay.

254
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:33,840
Thank you so much.

255
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,770
You're welcome.

256
00:10:36,300 --> 00:10:37,030
Presiding Judge,

257
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:38,910
I request permission
to question the defendant

258
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:41,320
regarding the newly supplemented evidence.

259
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:41,850
Granted.

260
00:10:43,750 --> 00:10:44,600
Defendant, do you recognize

261
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,330
this jacket?

262
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:48,550
Yes.

263
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:49,840
It's mine.

264
00:10:50,630 --> 00:10:52,560
The suit the defendant was wearing

265
00:10:52,790 --> 00:10:54,200
has no bloodstains on it,

266
00:10:54,390 --> 00:10:54,910
nor any signs

267
00:10:54,910 --> 00:10:56,240
of having been cleaned.

268
00:10:56,510 --> 00:10:57,970
On the night of October 17,

269
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,790
were you wearing it the whole time?

270
00:10:59,790 --> 00:11:01,440
I had it on when I left after drinking

271
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:02,240
with Liu.

272
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:04,030
He can testify.

273
00:11:09,790 --> 00:11:10,200
So

274
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,020
when you killed Yin Ping,

275
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:12,820
were you also wearing this suit?

276
00:11:19,510 --> 00:11:21,510
I didn't kill him!
What are you talking about?

277
00:11:21,510 --> 00:11:22,640
How can you set me up?

278
00:11:22,670 --> 00:11:23,930
We are on the same side!

279
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:25,620
Presiding Judge.

280
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:26,480
Can he ask that?

281
00:11:26,510 --> 00:11:27,770
Are you allowing this?

282
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:35,160
I have no further questions.

283
00:11:39,470 --> 00:11:40,920
Dad, calm down.

284
00:12:03,550 --> 00:12:04,750
That was a risky move.

285
00:12:05,170 --> 00:12:06,240
What if Hu Xudong had taken the bait?

286
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:06,840
Then what?

287
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:08,150
You'd have shot yourself in the foot

288
00:12:08,150 --> 00:12:09,610
and blown the whole thing.

289
00:12:12,440 --> 00:12:13,390
Never ask your client questions

290
00:12:13,390 --> 00:12:14,550
you don't know the answer to.

291
00:12:14,550 --> 00:12:16,320
Isn't that basic?

292
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:23,750
Why aren't you eating?

293
00:12:23,750 --> 00:12:24,810
You that stressed?

294
00:12:25,150 --> 00:12:26,550
Whether you're the prosecution

295
00:12:26,550 --> 00:12:27,610
or the defense,

296
00:12:28,170 --> 00:12:29,720
in the end, it all comes down to

297
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,240
what you've got in your hand.

298
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:32,360
You take what you have

299
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,200
and hit them where they're weak—

300
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,260
that's how you win.

301
00:12:34,790 --> 00:12:35,320
But right now,

302
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,440
we've got nothing.

303
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,320
If we had

304
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,700
even only one

305
00:12:39,910 --> 00:12:41,360
solid, direct piece of evidence,

306
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:42,550
we could completely dismantle

307
00:12:42,550 --> 00:12:43,610
their entire case.

308
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:44,730
But we don't.

309
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:46,620
What do we have now?

310
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,280
Logical inferences.

311
00:12:48,510 --> 00:12:49,570
Reasonable doubt.

312
00:12:49,980 --> 00:12:50,690
Useless.

313
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,360
They aren't evidence.

314
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,360
We can't use them.

315
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,840
But then again,
they don't have evidence either.

316
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:55,100
So why should they win?

317
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,170
In this case,

318
00:12:57,390 --> 00:12:58,590
whether we win or lose

319
00:12:58,720 --> 00:13:00,030
ultimately depends on

320
00:13:00,030 --> 00:13:01,160
how the judge rules.

321
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,580
You want to win?

322
00:13:03,270 --> 00:13:04,030
If you were just here to win,

323
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:05,230
I wouldn't have come.

324
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,720
Don't worry.

325
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,420
We can't win this lawsuit.

326
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,410
Logically speaking,

327
00:13:12,410 --> 00:13:14,440
if we apply the principle
of innocent until proven guilty,

328
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:15,500
isn't he innocent?

329
00:13:16,070 --> 00:13:16,480
Right?

330
00:13:16,670 --> 00:13:17,550
We shouldn't even be here,

331
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:18,630
wasting our time with them.

332
00:13:18,630 --> 00:13:19,510
Logically speaking,

333
00:13:19,510 --> 00:13:21,030
I should be in Nanyu right now,

334
00:13:21,030 --> 00:13:22,200
keeping my wife company

335
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,320
and coaxing my daughter.

336
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,360
Instead, I'm here watching you

337
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,000
all slumped over,

338
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,730
second-guessing everything.

339
00:13:31,310 --> 00:13:31,970
Hurry up.

340
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,400
Court's back in session.

341
00:13:33,630 --> 00:13:34,690
This meal is on you.

342
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:13,600
Xiaowen.

343
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,550
Here is 70,000 yuan.

344
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,880
Your mom saved it her whole life.

345
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:26,200
Take it out now

346
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,200
and use it for your mom's treatment.

347
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:33,620
If something happens to me...

348
00:14:35,360 --> 00:14:37,630
If something happens, you keep it.

349
00:14:38,630 --> 00:14:39,690
If it's not enough,

350
00:14:41,630 --> 00:14:42,960
sell the house.

351
00:14:43,670 --> 00:14:45,400
It won't fetch much, but still.

352
00:14:53,510 --> 00:14:55,270
Did your mom say

353
00:14:55,790 --> 00:14:56,750
anything to you?

354
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:19,870
To the police:

355
00:15:20,550 --> 00:15:24,030
My husband, Qin Zhigao,

356
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:26,830
is a good man.

357
00:15:27,440 --> 00:15:29,720
He has nothing to do with my death.

358
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:32,630
Wife of Qin Zhigao,

359
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:35,840
Gao Qiuyue—final note.

360
00:15:49,150 --> 00:15:50,080
Now, defender, you may present

361
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,410
your closing argument.

362
00:15:53,030 --> 00:15:56,120
Honorable Presiding Judge, Judge,

363
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,570
honorable Prosecutor,

364
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:02,480
my client, Hu Xudong,

365
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:05,480
is an honest, law-abiding citizen.

366
00:16:06,910 --> 00:16:09,570
Now he sits handcuffed
in the defendant's dock,

367
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:11,030
on the basis of

368
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:14,200
a chain of evidence riddled with

369
00:16:14,270 --> 00:16:16,330
reasonable doubt and glaring holes.

370
00:16:17,550 --> 00:16:20,360
He stands accused of
using his treasured bayonet

371
00:16:21,150 --> 00:16:22,150
to stab to death

372
00:16:22,150 --> 00:16:23,840
a mentally ill person who couldn't even

373
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,500
understand what crime means.

374
00:16:27,910 --> 00:16:29,120
This evidence,

375
00:16:30,630 --> 00:16:32,030
is more rusted over

376
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:34,520
than the alleged murder weapon itself.

377
00:16:36,550 --> 00:16:38,350
We have witnesses who can attest

378
00:16:38,800 --> 00:16:39,600
that Hu Xudong

379
00:16:39,750 --> 00:16:42,750
had a good relationship
with Yin Ping's grandmother.

380
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,390
In daily life,

381
00:16:44,630 --> 00:16:46,150
he often helped Yin Ping's family

382
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:47,070
with farm work,

383
00:16:47,270 --> 00:16:49,070
lending a hand whenever needed.

384
00:16:49,250 --> 00:16:51,840
After Yin Ping burned down

385
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,440
Hu Xudong's livestock shed,

386
00:16:53,660 --> 00:16:55,320
he did not resort to violence,

387
00:16:55,390 --> 00:16:57,200
nor did he go over to pick a fight.

388
00:16:58,150 --> 00:16:59,960
He chose to trust the law,

389
00:17:00,150 --> 00:17:01,200
went to court,

390
00:17:02,670 --> 00:17:04,470
and sought help from the system.

391
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:10,410
Yet such a man

392
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,500
who trusts the law,

393
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:13,589
was arrested right before

394
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:15,130
his wedding.

395
00:17:16,750 --> 00:17:18,160
He was branded

396
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:19,839
a murderer.

397
00:17:22,589 --> 00:17:24,750
If the law turns a blind eye,

398
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:27,440
and suspicion outweighs evidence,

399
00:17:28,349 --> 00:17:29,480
then are we truly

400
00:17:29,510 --> 00:17:30,570
punishing crimes,

401
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:33,110
or are we creating new victims?

402
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:38,120
When a person on trial

403
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:39,810
walks into a courtroom,

404
00:17:41,030 --> 00:17:42,160
they should be met

405
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:44,620
by the steady hand of justice,

406
00:17:45,070 --> 00:17:46,680
not the roll of a loaded die.

407
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:49,960
Yin Ping has already died

408
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,160
for no good reason.

409
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:55,790
His grandmother took her own life
in grief.

410
00:17:57,830 --> 00:17:59,230
This is a family tragedy.

411
00:18:01,550 --> 00:18:03,200
Are we going to let Hu Xudong,

412
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:05,200
a man who believes in the law,

413
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:06,840
who believes in justice,

414
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:09,800
die under a false charge as well?

415
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:16,960
Are we going to create

416
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:18,360
another family tragedy?

417
00:18:21,790 --> 00:18:22,850
I'm not saying this

418
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:26,960
to appeal to

419
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,090
anyone's sympathy.

420
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,000
On behalf of everyone
who believes in justice

421
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:33,330
and believes in the law,

422
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:35,300
I implore the court

423
00:18:36,030 --> 00:18:37,110
to give Hu Xudong

424
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:38,790
a fair

425
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:40,480
and just verdict.

426
00:18:44,350 --> 00:18:45,010
That is all.

427
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,070
Yizhong,

428
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,040
when is the next hearing?

429
00:18:58,110 --> 00:18:59,510
The time hasn't been set.

430
00:19:00,110 --> 00:19:01,240
The court is taking

431
00:19:01,750 --> 00:19:03,210
this case very seriously.

432
00:19:03,790 --> 00:19:05,110
I heard about last session.

433
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:06,920
You did a great job.

434
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:07,920
In the first half,

435
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:10,030
you really tore some holes

436
00:19:10,510 --> 00:19:12,640
in the prosecution's evidence chain.

437
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:15,270
That was well done.

438
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:18,110
But the latter part got a little too

439
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:19,310
emotional.

440
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:21,210
You're being too harsh.

441
00:19:21,750 --> 00:19:23,680
If the substantive law
were detailed enough

442
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:24,790
and the procedural law were solid enough,

443
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:26,270
would he need to defend so vaguely?

444
00:19:26,270 --> 00:19:28,030
Zhou, you're just covering for your guy.

445
00:19:28,030 --> 00:19:29,430
You're just nitpicking.

446
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:32,150
Mr. Cheng is right.

447
00:19:32,430 --> 00:19:33,830
Actually, I realized it.

448
00:19:34,030 --> 00:19:35,070
If I hadn't

449
00:19:35,310 --> 00:19:37,310
asked Lu Zeming to help me this time,

450
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:39,550
I might have been even more out of touch.

451
00:19:39,550 --> 00:19:41,280
At least he hasn't gone astray.

452
00:19:43,110 --> 00:19:44,440
But from this practice,

453
00:19:45,350 --> 00:19:46,440
I've gained a lot.

454
00:19:48,310 --> 00:19:49,380
It's a reminder

455
00:19:49,930 --> 00:19:51,240
that when I do theoretical research later,

456
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,640
I need to always remember

457
00:19:53,200 --> 00:19:54,460
not to work in a vacuum.

458
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:57,170
This round of legal reform,

459
00:19:57,350 --> 00:19:58,240
whether it's

460
00:19:59,110 --> 00:20:01,030
the newly implemented procedural law,

461
00:20:01,030 --> 00:20:02,890
or the criminal law up for review,

462
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:05,050
compared to before,

463
00:20:06,110 --> 00:20:07,240
there's some progress.

464
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:08,790
But real‑world problems

465
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,680
cannot be fixed overnight.

466
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:11,810
It is also difficult

467
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:14,920
to bring about a complete improvement.

468
00:20:17,960 --> 00:20:19,020
We're getting old,

469
00:20:20,950 --> 00:20:21,880
especially him.

470
00:20:22,180 --> 00:20:23,190
Those old bones

471
00:20:23,270 --> 00:20:24,800
won't hold out much longer.

472
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,270
The future

473
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:29,810
rests on you younger generations.

474
00:20:31,150 --> 00:20:32,440
What about Yu Gaoyuan?

475
00:20:32,470 --> 00:20:34,000
How do you think he'll rule?

476
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:38,300
Hard to say.

477
00:20:39,270 --> 00:20:40,160
His ruling

478
00:20:42,590 --> 00:20:43,440
won't just be about

479
00:20:43,440 --> 00:20:44,270
this case.

480
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:51,240
I still think it should be
the death penalty.

481
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:52,370
He recanted in court

482
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:53,600
and acted so defiant.

483
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:54,340
There's

484
00:20:54,340 --> 00:20:56,270
no grounds for leniency in my view.

485
00:20:57,310 --> 00:20:58,170
Court Pres. Yu,

486
00:20:58,500 --> 00:20:59,640
I think we should investigate

487
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:00,370
this lawyer.

488
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:02,520
Did he instigate the defendant?

489
00:21:04,830 --> 00:21:06,560
Xia Yingjie, what do you think?

490
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:12,750
You don't think he's innocent, do you?

491
00:21:12,750 --> 00:21:14,150
I do think he's innocent.

492
00:21:14,510 --> 00:21:16,310
I had some reservations before,

493
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:18,550
but after the hearing,
I'm even more certain.

494
00:21:18,550 --> 00:21:19,160
Innocent?

495
00:21:19,590 --> 00:21:20,520
Are you kidding?

496
00:21:20,640 --> 00:21:22,100
This will cause an uproar.

497
00:21:23,490 --> 00:21:24,200
An acquittal

498
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:25,830
would indeed cause too much of a stir.

499
00:21:25,830 --> 00:21:28,070
I suggest persuading the procuratorate
to drop the charges

500
00:21:28,070 --> 00:21:29,600
and resolve it internally.

501
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,070
That's easy

502
00:21:33,510 --> 00:21:34,780
for you to say.

503
00:21:35,750 --> 00:21:36,310
Zhang.

504
00:21:37,350 --> 00:21:39,000
Whether I'm standing or sitting,

505
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,400
I have the right to speak.

506
00:21:41,000 --> 00:21:42,880
Court Pres. Yu's back isn't hurting yet,

507
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:44,880
and you're already worried for him.

508
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,170
Let's eat first.

509
00:21:51,520 --> 00:21:53,650
The cafeteria has braised pork today.

510
00:22:04,520 --> 00:22:05,310
There's something

511
00:22:05,310 --> 00:22:06,370
I held back in front of that

512
00:22:06,370 --> 00:22:07,170
brown-noser.

513
00:22:09,270 --> 00:22:11,590
We should have returned the case file
from the start.

514
00:22:11,590 --> 00:22:12,920
Now that we've held trial,

515
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:14,250
it's a hot‑potato case.

516
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:16,140
We can't swallow it,

517
00:22:16,140 --> 00:22:17,270
and we can't throw it away either.

518
00:22:17,270 --> 00:22:18,030
You think returning the file is that easy,

519
00:22:18,030 --> 00:22:19,230
Comrade Xia Yingjie?

520
00:22:22,550 --> 00:22:23,110
Yu,

521
00:22:23,960 --> 00:22:25,960
forget you're the court president.

522
00:22:26,040 --> 00:22:27,000
Just think of yourself

523
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:28,830
as an ordinary legal professional.

524
00:22:28,830 --> 00:22:29,680
After hearing the trial

525
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:31,540
and Yizhong's defense argument,

526
00:22:31,590 --> 00:22:32,350
do you really believe

527
00:22:32,350 --> 00:22:33,680
Hu Xudong is the killer?

528
00:22:33,750 --> 00:22:35,110
Do you only trust my honesty

529
00:22:35,110 --> 00:22:36,270
if I give you the answer you want to hear?

530
00:22:36,270 --> 00:22:36,670
Right?

531
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,070
I trust your judgment.

532
00:22:40,070 --> 00:22:40,960
I trust the law.

533
00:22:45,070 --> 00:22:45,400
Okay.

534
00:22:46,160 --> 00:22:47,420
Deputy Court Pres. Yu.

535
00:23:01,490 --> 00:23:01,970
Mentor.

536
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:03,000
I just went to

537
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:05,520
the Nanlu Intermediate
People's Court again.

538
00:23:05,520 --> 00:23:06,920
They act like they've never even heard

539
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:07,740
of my case.

540
00:23:07,770 --> 00:23:09,100
Completely blew me off.

541
00:23:10,590 --> 00:23:11,350
I think

542
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:12,680
we need to put more effort

543
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:13,500
into the High Court.

544
00:23:13,500 --> 00:23:14,270
Pull some strings.

545
00:23:14,270 --> 00:23:15,470
Maybe that will work.

546
00:23:15,800 --> 00:23:17,210
Let them see

547
00:23:17,240 --> 00:23:18,200
what it feels like when a higher-up

548
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:19,030
pulls rank.

549
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:22,440
Yes.

550
00:23:27,210 --> 00:23:29,700
[Nanlu 526 Rape-Murder: A Trail of Doubt,
A Two-Generation Quest for Justice]

551
00:23:29,030 --> 00:23:29,640
Mentor.

552
00:23:30,880 --> 00:23:31,940
They published it.

553
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,480
This report

554
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:36,350
has been reprinted
by many media outlets nationwide.

555
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:38,640
I hear that authorities in Beijing
are also paying close attention to it.

556
00:23:38,640 --> 00:23:39,750
We're in a tough spot now,

557
00:23:39,750 --> 00:23:40,380
comrades.

558
00:23:41,070 --> 00:23:41,550
Yes.

559
00:23:42,160 --> 00:23:43,510
The Provincial High Court has also

560
00:23:43,510 --> 00:23:45,440
reached out to us for clarification.

561
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:46,550
Everyone in our court

562
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:47,680
is talking about it.

563
00:23:47,680 --> 00:23:49,070
They're all waiting to see.

564
00:23:49,070 --> 00:23:49,640
See what?

565
00:23:50,510 --> 00:23:51,310
See the drama?

566
00:23:51,680 --> 00:23:54,010
People have all sorts of thoughts anyway.

567
00:23:59,550 --> 00:24:00,880
Sorry to interrupt, everyone.

568
00:24:00,880 --> 00:24:01,440
It's an emergency.

569
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:02,640
I must report to the chief.

570
00:24:02,640 --> 00:24:03,170
Go ahead.

571
00:24:03,550 --> 00:24:04,550
There is an inmate
in Jiangbei Detention Center

572
00:24:04,550 --> 00:24:05,190
named Jia Peng.

573
00:24:05,190 --> 00:24:05,940
He confessed

574
00:24:06,070 --> 00:24:07,330
that he killed Lin Yan.

575
00:24:07,460 --> 00:24:08,270
The local police

576
00:24:08,270 --> 00:24:09,110
have already sent over

577
00:24:09,110 --> 00:24:10,440
the assistance notice.

578
00:24:14,830 --> 00:24:17,110
The investigation team will be here soon.

579
00:24:17,110 --> 00:24:17,570
Mentor,

580
00:24:18,480 --> 00:24:20,480
do you have any instructions for me?

581
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,460
You're the leader.

582
00:24:23,640 --> 00:24:25,440
What instructions could I have?

583
00:24:26,070 --> 00:24:26,920
Mentor,

584
00:24:27,030 --> 00:24:28,160
at a time like this,

585
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,880
let's stop playing dumb.

586
00:24:36,310 --> 00:24:37,590
Do you think Jia Peng

587
00:24:37,690 --> 00:24:38,720
can read newspapers

588
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:40,120
in the detention center?

589
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:41,760
Can he talk to other inmates?

590
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:43,410
What do you mean?

591
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:44,510
Look,

592
00:24:45,030 --> 00:24:46,160
verifying the case

593
00:24:46,510 --> 00:24:48,710
will probably take two or three months.

594
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:50,160
He never confessed before,

595
00:24:50,160 --> 00:24:53,080
but confessed everything
the moment it hit the papers.

596
00:24:53,080 --> 00:24:53,780
These guys,

597
00:24:53,800 --> 00:24:54,790
just to buy themselves a few more days,

598
00:24:54,790 --> 00:24:55,550
would even claim

599
00:24:55,550 --> 00:24:57,110
they've eaten the flesh of immortals.

600
00:24:57,110 --> 00:24:58,270
You've been trying

601
00:24:58,270 --> 00:24:58,920
to match that

602
00:24:58,920 --> 00:24:59,590
DNA, right?

603
00:25:00,350 --> 00:25:01,410
This is our chance.

604
00:25:02,750 --> 00:25:04,750
I think the confession matters too.

605
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:06,550
We should ask him some things

606
00:25:06,550 --> 00:25:08,080
that weren't in the papers.

607
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:12,260
You don't need to instruct me on that.

608
00:25:12,550 --> 00:25:13,290
Lihui.

609
00:25:14,500 --> 00:25:16,630
When our procuratorate accepted you,

610
00:25:16,790 --> 00:25:17,790
it was because we saw you as

611
00:25:17,790 --> 00:25:19,510
someone with both advanced degrees

612
00:25:19,510 --> 00:25:21,200
and hands-on experience—

613
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:22,680
a well-rounded professional.

614
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:24,400
A female PhD

615
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:26,790
spending seven or eight years in a prison—

616
00:25:26,790 --> 00:25:27,990
that's no small feat.

617
00:25:29,170 --> 00:25:29,790
So when they

618
00:25:29,790 --> 00:25:30,640
brought it up at the meeting,

619
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:32,100
I made the call right away.

620
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:33,110
If we don't grab talent like you,

621
00:25:33,110 --> 00:25:33,640
who will?

622
00:25:34,110 --> 00:25:35,110
We had to have you.

623
00:25:35,910 --> 00:25:37,440
I appreciate the procuratorate's
recognition.

624
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:38,840
And your support, Chief.

625
00:25:41,010 --> 00:25:41,950
You know,

626
00:25:42,440 --> 00:25:44,380
I dread dealing with the media.

627
00:25:45,120 --> 00:25:46,270
Not for any particular reason,

628
00:25:46,270 --> 00:25:47,960
I'm just not good with words.

629
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:50,400
So from now on,
whenever the procuratorate needs,

630
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:51,310
publicity work

631
00:25:51,720 --> 00:25:53,350
or media relations,

632
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:55,320
I'd rather you handle it.

633
00:25:56,190 --> 00:25:57,630
Chief Prosecutor, I...

634
00:25:58,030 --> 00:26:01,490
I didn't mean to make things difficult
for our procuratorate.

635
00:26:01,750 --> 00:26:03,350
Am I being too unreasonable?

636
00:26:03,750 --> 00:26:04,930
Not at all.

637
00:26:06,350 --> 00:26:08,130
Appealing for unjust cases

638
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:09,240
and pursuing the truth

639
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:09,750
is precisely

640
00:26:09,750 --> 00:26:11,550
the duty of a resident prosecutor.

641
00:26:11,550 --> 00:26:13,210
Asking us to support your work

642
00:26:13,750 --> 00:26:14,790
is only right.

643
00:26:16,230 --> 00:26:17,430
Don't put it that way.

644
00:26:18,480 --> 00:26:19,720
You make me feel like an outsider.

645
00:26:19,720 --> 00:26:20,780
Alright, alright.

646
00:26:20,920 --> 00:26:21,920
Just kidding.

647
00:26:24,550 --> 00:26:25,070
Lihui,

648
00:26:26,110 --> 00:26:27,030
to be honest,

649
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:29,080
regarding this case,

650
00:26:29,110 --> 00:26:31,110
some comrades in the procuratorate

651
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:34,620
have their reservations.

652
00:26:34,750 --> 00:26:35,610
That's normal.

653
00:26:36,270 --> 00:26:36,870
After all,

654
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:38,550
everyone put a lot of work

655
00:26:38,550 --> 00:26:40,070
into this case

656
00:26:40,920 --> 00:26:42,110
and took some hits too.

657
00:26:42,110 --> 00:26:44,270
Now suddenly having to do it
all over again,

658
00:26:44,270 --> 00:26:45,400
anyone would need time

659
00:26:45,400 --> 00:26:46,860
to come to terms with that.

660
00:26:46,920 --> 00:26:47,310
Yes.

661
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:49,330
So don't feel burdened.

662
00:26:49,760 --> 00:26:50,680
The procuratorate

663
00:26:50,680 --> 00:26:52,210
will seek truth from facts,

664
00:26:52,310 --> 00:26:53,170
no covering up.

665
00:26:53,270 --> 00:26:54,550
The higher-ups have decided

666
00:26:54,550 --> 00:26:55,390
to set up a

667
00:26:55,550 --> 00:26:57,030
special investigation team

668
00:26:57,030 --> 00:26:59,290
to formally look into the Yan Jicai case.

669
00:26:59,720 --> 00:27:01,070
You're on the team.

670
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:03,590
What?

671
00:27:04,350 --> 00:27:05,880
We've laid out the conditions for you.

672
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:06,880
Now it's up to you.

673
00:27:07,880 --> 00:27:09,350
Don't hold back.

674
00:27:09,750 --> 00:27:10,950
If you need anything,

675
00:27:11,310 --> 00:27:12,440
come straight to me.

676
00:27:12,590 --> 00:27:13,190
Right now,

677
00:27:13,270 --> 00:27:16,310
the Municipal Bureau is urgently
bringing Jia Peng in for questioning.

678
00:27:16,310 --> 00:27:17,750
You know the Yan Jicai case

679
00:27:17,750 --> 00:27:18,410
inside out.

680
00:27:18,840 --> 00:27:19,780
So go with them.

681
00:27:20,960 --> 00:27:22,240
Okay.

682
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:24,490
Thank you, Chief Prosecutor.

683
00:27:55,510 --> 00:27:56,070
Name.

684
00:27:57,240 --> 00:27:58,040
Jia Peng.

685
00:27:59,400 --> 00:28:00,510
Jia as in Jia Baoyu.

686
00:28:01,440 --> 00:28:02,770
Peng as in the Peng bird.

687
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:05,960
Do you know

688
00:28:06,210 --> 00:28:07,410
why we're here today?

689
00:28:09,110 --> 00:28:09,620
I know.

690
00:28:11,030 --> 00:28:12,290
Because I killed a girl

691
00:28:13,440 --> 00:28:14,240
named Lin Yan.

692
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:15,320
Right?

693
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:18,200
Do you remember which day it was?

694
00:28:23,880 --> 00:28:24,440
I do.

695
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:28,640
July 9, 1991, late at night.

696
00:28:29,550 --> 00:28:30,400
The grove

697
00:28:30,750 --> 00:28:32,030
by the main boulevard,

698
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:35,000
in the Sci-Tech Development Zone,
Nanlu City.

699
00:28:40,360 --> 00:28:42,090
Tell us exactly what happened.

700
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:55,640
I like girls like you.

701
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:58,860
You look all quiet and proper,

702
00:28:59,260 --> 00:29:00,080
but actually,

703
00:29:00,110 --> 00:29:01,550
I bet you've got some fire.

704
00:29:01,550 --> 00:29:03,080
Jia Peng, behave yourself.

705
00:29:03,750 --> 00:29:04,640
Your death penalty review

706
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:05,680
will be approved soon.

707
00:29:05,680 --> 00:29:07,080
This is your last chance.

708
00:29:11,880 --> 00:29:13,270
What's the rush?

709
00:29:14,110 --> 00:29:15,200
I know the law too.

710
00:29:16,230 --> 00:29:17,360
Let's take our time.

711
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:22,030
This case happened

712
00:29:22,030 --> 00:29:22,830
years ago.

713
00:29:23,960 --> 00:29:25,960
You remember the date that clearly?

714
00:29:28,110 --> 00:29:29,310
Because July 9

715
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:31,650
is my birthday.

716
00:29:40,270 --> 00:29:40,790
Hello?

717
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:43,240
Lihui.

718
00:29:43,830 --> 00:29:44,790
Your mentor hasn't been

719
00:29:44,790 --> 00:29:46,170
feeling well these days.

720
00:29:46,170 --> 00:29:47,040
Could you maybe

721
00:29:47,070 --> 00:29:48,070
not call anymore?

722
00:30:05,070 --> 00:30:06,540
Talk to me. Kiddo.

723
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:09,030
Let's talk tomorrow.

724
00:30:09,030 --> 00:30:10,290
You should go rest now.

725
00:30:10,500 --> 00:30:11,440
No, no.

726
00:30:13,830 --> 00:30:14,880
My wife

727
00:30:15,590 --> 00:30:17,450
acts this way not just toward you,

728
00:30:17,480 --> 00:30:18,790
but toward everyone.

729
00:30:20,110 --> 00:30:21,590
Looking after me

730
00:30:23,110 --> 00:30:24,070
has just

731
00:30:25,830 --> 00:30:26,880
worn her out.

732
00:30:29,960 --> 00:30:30,640
Kiddo,

733
00:30:32,150 --> 00:30:33,350
forgive her.

734
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:35,820
It's clearly my fault.

735
00:30:36,510 --> 00:30:38,440
I should've called during the day.

736
00:30:38,540 --> 00:30:39,450
Get some rest.

737
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:40,740
You don't sound right.

738
00:30:41,960 --> 00:30:43,200
Any progress?

739
00:30:44,590 --> 00:30:45,550
He accidentally

740
00:30:45,570 --> 00:30:46,700
let slip one detail.

741
00:30:47,370 --> 00:30:48,440
The police officer is young

742
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:50,240
and isn't the one
who handled the case back then,

743
00:30:50,240 --> 00:30:51,640
so he probably didn't notice.

744
00:30:51,640 --> 00:30:52,550
But it gave me

745
00:30:52,830 --> 00:30:53,630
quite a shock.

746
00:30:53,920 --> 00:30:57,380
Is it that detail only found

747
00:30:58,110 --> 00:30:59,040
in the case file?

748
00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:00,920
He said

749
00:31:01,510 --> 00:31:02,790
the day Lin Yan was killed,

750
00:31:02,790 --> 00:31:04,520
she was wearing white sandals.

751
00:31:04,830 --> 00:31:06,290
It was those white sandals

752
00:31:06,440 --> 00:31:08,370
that sparked his wicked thoughts.

753
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:09,960
But those white sandals

754
00:31:10,200 --> 00:31:11,530
were never made public.

755
00:31:13,870 --> 00:31:15,280
Mentor, to be honest,

756
00:31:15,310 --> 00:31:16,770
I'm conflicted right now.

757
00:31:17,680 --> 00:31:18,480
I understand.

758
00:31:20,510 --> 00:31:22,720
You're hoping

759
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:26,010
that the real killer is Jia Peng.

760
00:31:27,550 --> 00:31:29,270
But you don't want

761
00:31:30,160 --> 00:31:32,110
to be blinded by this hope.

762
00:31:34,350 --> 00:31:36,610
I also want to find other possibilities.

763
00:31:37,590 --> 00:31:38,240
Kiddo.

764
00:31:39,960 --> 00:31:40,680
If...

765
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:42,440
If this...

766
00:31:42,790 --> 00:31:44,150
If this Jia Peng

767
00:31:44,550 --> 00:31:46,000
is not the murderer,

768
00:31:47,250 --> 00:31:48,930
but still knows all this,

769
00:31:48,960 --> 00:31:49,560
then there

770
00:31:50,720 --> 00:31:52,650
are three possible explanations.

771
00:31:57,720 --> 00:31:58,270
Mentor.

772
00:32:00,960 --> 00:32:01,670
Lihui.

773
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:03,670
Let's talk about it tomorrow, okay?

774
00:32:03,670 --> 00:32:05,730
Your mentor can't hold on any longer.

775
00:32:15,640 --> 00:32:16,200
Kiddo,

776
00:32:17,030 --> 00:32:18,030
Keep digging.

777
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:20,510
As for me,

778
00:32:21,880 --> 00:32:23,920
I'll head back to Bieshan
as soon as possible.

779
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:25,270
You're not going anywhere.

780
00:32:25,270 --> 00:32:25,790
I'll go.

781
00:32:27,020 --> 00:32:28,160
You're coughing that bad.

782
00:32:28,160 --> 00:32:29,400
Where are you even going?

783
00:32:29,400 --> 00:32:32,640
I also hope Jia Peng is the real killer,

784
00:32:33,730 --> 00:32:35,200
but more than that,

785
00:32:36,270 --> 00:32:38,030
I want this case—

786
00:32:38,420 --> 00:32:39,340
this case—

787
00:32:39,990 --> 00:32:42,170
to be overturned so solidly

788
00:32:42,830 --> 00:32:44,360
that there's no doubt left.

789
00:32:45,030 --> 00:32:45,550
Right?

790
00:32:46,920 --> 00:32:48,000
I just—

791
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:52,240
I can't wait for that day.

792
00:32:53,240 --> 00:32:54,000
Mentor.

793
00:32:55,310 --> 00:32:57,110
Don't say things like that anymore.

794
00:32:57,110 --> 00:32:57,970
I can't bear it.

795
00:32:59,110 --> 00:33:00,050
Get some rest now.

796
00:33:00,050 --> 00:33:00,910
I'm hanging up.

797
00:33:07,090 --> 00:33:07,750
Here's what I'm thinking:

798
00:33:07,750 --> 00:33:09,680
withdraw the charges for now,

799
00:33:10,240 --> 00:33:12,960
have the police conduct
supplementary investigation,

800
00:33:12,960 --> 00:33:14,510
and we'll see where things stand.

801
00:33:14,510 --> 00:33:16,400
If the evidence is solid by then,

802
00:33:16,420 --> 00:33:17,750
we'll cooperate fully.

803
00:33:20,700 --> 00:33:21,810
Right, everyone's

804
00:33:21,830 --> 00:33:23,200
in a tough spot right now.

805
00:33:23,200 --> 00:33:24,270
Keeping the impact minimal

806
00:33:24,270 --> 00:33:25,110
would be better for everyone.

807
00:33:25,110 --> 00:33:26,440
I know a withdrawal looks bad,

808
00:33:26,440 --> 00:33:27,440
but if it ends in an acquittal,

809
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:29,370
that'll be even worse for you guys.

810
00:33:33,070 --> 00:33:34,270
You don't believe me?

811
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:34,960
No.

812
00:33:35,790 --> 00:33:36,650
Don't bluff me.

813
00:33:36,750 --> 00:33:38,550
Even if your collegial panel
rules not guilty,

814
00:33:38,550 --> 00:33:39,350
you won't get past

815
00:33:39,350 --> 00:33:41,010
the Adjudication Committee.

816
00:33:41,530 --> 00:33:42,400
And the victim's family

817
00:33:42,400 --> 00:33:43,930
will demand that we appeal.

818
00:33:44,720 --> 00:33:46,200
Don't forget—he's a journalist.

819
00:33:46,200 --> 00:33:47,960
That'll make an even bigger scene.

820
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:50,290
You're the ones who'll be in trouble then.

821
00:33:50,640 --> 00:33:52,270
You don't dare to acquit him,

822
00:33:52,590 --> 00:33:54,480
so you came to us to withdraw the case,
right?

823
00:33:54,480 --> 00:33:56,480
We're just taking a shot in the dark.

824
00:33:58,110 --> 00:33:59,880
I understand your difficulties.

825
00:33:59,880 --> 00:34:01,350
We also have a Procuratorial Committee.

826
00:34:01,350 --> 00:34:02,000
Otherwise, would I have let

827
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:03,730
evidence like that go to trial?

828
00:34:04,600 --> 00:34:05,200
Do you truly believe

829
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,800
Hu Xudong committed murder?

830
00:34:21,739 --> 00:34:25,989
[Binjiang Intermediate People's Court]

831
00:34:26,880 --> 00:34:27,540
Not guilty.

832
00:34:29,510 --> 00:34:30,510
What do you think?

833
00:34:31,670 --> 00:34:33,199
It's not about what I think.

834
00:34:34,219 --> 00:34:35,320
It was the entire trial process

835
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:36,380
that convinced me.

836
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:38,150
When you were reviewing the files,

837
00:34:38,150 --> 00:34:39,949
why weren't you convinced then?

838
00:34:41,110 --> 00:34:42,840
A case has to be heard in person.

839
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:44,030
A judge's direct experience

840
00:34:44,030 --> 00:34:46,800
and the immediacy of oral testimony
matter so much.

841
00:34:46,800 --> 00:34:47,590
Relying solely on case files

842
00:34:47,590 --> 00:34:49,120
is always one step removed.

843
00:34:49,280 --> 00:34:50,150
From what you're saying,

844
00:34:50,150 --> 00:34:51,480
you think there's something wrong

845
00:34:51,480 --> 00:34:52,449
with our Adjudication Committee system?

846
00:34:52,449 --> 00:34:53,800
Trying without judging,
judging without trying—

847
00:34:53,800 --> 00:34:55,030
that's indeed a problem

848
00:34:55,030 --> 00:34:56,360
in our trial mechanism.

849
00:34:56,860 --> 00:34:57,760
At this critical moment,

850
00:34:57,760 --> 00:35:00,020
you're reflecting on the system with me?

851
00:35:02,640 --> 00:35:03,920
Who was it that swore to me

852
00:35:03,920 --> 00:35:04,340
back then

853
00:35:04,340 --> 00:35:06,740
that they would handle this case properly?

854
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:08,030
Reversing to an acquittal

855
00:35:08,030 --> 00:35:09,560
is for the good of our court.

856
00:35:10,120 --> 00:35:11,320
I've thought this through

857
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:12,320
for a long time.

858
00:35:12,890 --> 00:35:14,230
If we cave under pressure,

859
00:35:14,230 --> 00:35:16,630
what if we end up with
another Qian Xingliang case?

860
00:35:16,630 --> 00:35:17,480
I don't need you

861
00:35:17,480 --> 00:35:19,140
to spell out the stakes for me.

862
00:35:22,320 --> 00:35:23,590
I called you here today

863
00:35:24,320 --> 00:35:25,520
to show you this.

864
00:35:40,360 --> 00:35:41,490
What does this mean?

865
00:35:52,070 --> 00:35:53,600
Hasn't Court Pres. Yu arrived yet?

866
00:35:53,600 --> 00:35:54,190
I thought we were supposed

867
00:35:54,190 --> 00:35:55,630
to reach a conclusion today.

868
00:35:55,630 --> 00:35:56,880
Court Pres. Qiu called him away.

869
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:58,410
He asked us to wait a moment.

870
00:36:02,590 --> 00:36:03,240
So,

871
00:36:03,760 --> 00:36:05,630
you still stand by not‑guilty?

872
00:36:11,670 --> 00:36:13,110
Did Court Pres. Yu give you a hint?

873
00:36:13,110 --> 00:36:14,170
Which side is he on?

874
00:36:18,760 --> 00:36:19,590
If I had to bet,

875
00:36:20,670 --> 00:36:22,800
I'd say he's for the death penalty too.

876
00:36:26,320 --> 00:36:27,050
Judge Zhang.

877
00:36:28,190 --> 00:36:30,450
This is a human life we're talking about.

878
00:36:32,550 --> 00:36:33,030
You...

879
00:36:33,070 --> 00:36:34,230
Don't you have any sense

880
00:36:34,230 --> 00:36:34,920
of humor?

881
00:36:34,940 --> 00:36:35,200
This...

882
00:36:35,200 --> 00:36:36,860
Isn't this just a casual chat?

883
00:36:46,630 --> 00:36:47,110
Son.

884
00:36:49,770 --> 00:36:50,970
When are you

885
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:52,330
going back to Binjiang?

886
00:36:53,880 --> 00:36:56,610
Waiting for the court's notice
for a new hearing.

887
00:36:56,840 --> 00:36:57,190
What?

888
00:37:00,920 --> 00:37:02,050
There's something.

889
00:37:03,070 --> 00:37:04,550
This isn't your father's fault.

890
00:37:04,550 --> 00:37:05,960
Blame me if you have to.

891
00:37:06,880 --> 00:37:07,280
Oh no.

892
00:37:07,670 --> 00:37:09,070
This doesn't sound good.

893
00:37:09,710 --> 00:37:11,440
How could it not be a good thing?

894
00:37:12,360 --> 00:37:12,960
What is it?

895
00:37:14,360 --> 00:37:15,360
Here's the thing.

896
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:17,480
Your dad has a classmate,

897
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:20,320
whose old comrade-in-arms has a friend,
and that friend has a daughter...

898
00:37:20,320 --> 00:37:21,110
A blind date?

899
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:22,600
I'm not going.

900
00:37:22,880 --> 00:37:23,480
Come on.

901
00:37:24,670 --> 00:37:25,960
Why not?

902
00:37:26,550 --> 00:37:27,110
Let me tell you,

903
00:37:27,110 --> 00:37:28,710
her name is Tian Mei.

904
00:37:28,920 --> 00:37:30,580
Doesn't that name sound nice?

905
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:32,750
Just go meet her.

906
00:37:33,360 --> 00:37:34,890
Do it for your dad, at least.

907
00:37:36,320 --> 00:37:36,800
Mom.

908
00:37:37,320 --> 00:37:39,780
This kind of thing is never
going to work out.

909
00:37:39,800 --> 00:37:41,920
Showing up will only give her false hope

910
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:43,230
and make things awkward.

911
00:37:43,230 --> 00:37:43,710
Really.

912
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,410
From the sound of it,

913
00:37:48,230 --> 00:37:50,030
you and Xia are getting serious?

914
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:52,120
Very serious.

915
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:06,980
You looking for me?

916
00:38:22,640 --> 00:38:24,840
Why didn't the meeting continue today?

917
00:38:25,000 --> 00:38:27,400
Weren't we supposed to reach a conclusion?

918
00:38:28,710 --> 00:38:29,190
Listen to me—

919
00:38:29,190 --> 00:38:30,280
withdraw from this case right now.

920
00:38:30,280 --> 00:38:31,590
At worst, we'll hold a retrial.

921
00:38:31,590 --> 00:38:32,190
Why?

922
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:35,710
This morning, I went

923
00:38:35,710 --> 00:38:37,510
to see Court Pres. Qiu for a review.

924
00:38:37,510 --> 00:38:38,370
He gave me this.

925
00:38:40,110 --> 00:38:41,220
What does this mean?

926
00:38:41,220 --> 00:38:42,680
What do you think it means?

927
00:38:43,030 --> 00:38:44,630
Passing the buck, what else?

928
00:38:45,360 --> 00:38:46,030
Tell us—

929
00:38:46,720 --> 00:38:47,440
if there's any flaw

930
00:38:47,440 --> 00:38:48,340
in this verdict,

931
00:38:48,340 --> 00:38:49,670
we're both implicated.

932
00:38:51,030 --> 00:38:52,430
What is this, seriously?

933
00:38:53,280 --> 00:38:54,030
There were plenty of people

934
00:38:54,030 --> 00:38:55,760
there that day who can vouch for us.

935
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:56,510
We just ran into each other,

936
00:38:56,510 --> 00:38:57,730
and had one drink.

937
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:59,620
And that was because Lu had a baby.

938
00:39:01,630 --> 00:39:02,430
Who took this?

939
00:39:02,930 --> 00:39:04,110
Yin Ping's uncle.

940
00:39:05,390 --> 00:39:06,070
He found out

941
00:39:06,070 --> 00:39:07,470
that we were classmates.

942
00:39:08,150 --> 00:39:10,000
And he didn't even file a complaint.

943
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:11,400
He went directly to Court Pres. Qiu

944
00:39:11,400 --> 00:39:12,360
to report it.

945
00:39:13,420 --> 00:39:14,280
Imagine what would've happened

946
00:39:14,280 --> 00:39:15,580
if he'd formally filed a complaint.

947
00:39:15,580 --> 00:39:16,840
What is he trying to do?

948
00:39:18,670 --> 00:39:19,480
We are the court.

949
00:39:19,480 --> 00:39:21,280
Are we just going to be
blackmailed like this?

950
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:22,280
Isn't this a joke?

951
00:39:22,670 --> 00:39:24,200
Listen to me, withdraw now.

952
00:39:25,030 --> 00:39:25,550
This case has nothing

953
00:39:25,550 --> 00:39:26,810
to do with you anymore.

954
00:39:26,840 --> 00:39:28,360
If, and I mean if,

955
00:39:28,630 --> 00:39:29,480
this is a wrongful conviction,

956
00:39:29,480 --> 00:39:31,210
you won't be held responsible.

957
00:39:32,630 --> 00:39:33,490
So you admit it.

958
00:39:33,670 --> 00:39:34,330
Admit what?

959
00:39:35,320 --> 00:39:36,580
Hu Xudong is innocent.

960
00:39:36,960 --> 00:39:37,630
What I think right now

961
00:39:37,630 --> 00:39:39,070
is not important. Do you understand?

962
00:39:39,070 --> 00:39:39,630
How can what you think

963
00:39:39,630 --> 00:39:40,440
not be important?

964
00:39:40,440 --> 00:39:41,640
It's very important.

965
00:39:43,670 --> 00:39:44,550
This verdict isn't only

966
00:39:44,550 --> 00:39:45,400
about Hu Xudong.

967
00:39:45,400 --> 00:39:46,400
It's about you,

968
00:39:46,420 --> 00:39:47,300
Yu Gaoyuan.

969
00:39:47,640 --> 00:39:49,000
Your conscience, your judgment,

970
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:50,280
your courage in the face of difficulty!

971
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:51,360
Don't you get it yet?

972
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:52,630
Hu Xudong is dead at first instance.

973
00:39:52,630 --> 00:39:54,560
Life with a reprieve is a long shot!

974
00:39:56,230 --> 00:39:57,880
Even if the review doesn't go through,

975
00:39:57,880 --> 00:39:59,380
Yin Ping's uncle will run these photos

976
00:39:59,380 --> 00:40:01,240
into the ground. What will you do?

977
00:40:03,550 --> 00:40:04,230
You've already got

978
00:40:04,230 --> 00:40:05,070
the Qian Xingliang case on your record.

979
00:40:05,070 --> 00:40:07,130
You think you'll get another chance?

980
00:40:07,560 --> 00:40:09,120
If you sign off on

981
00:40:09,150 --> 00:40:09,550
a death sentence,

982
00:40:09,550 --> 00:40:10,800
you won't even be a judge anymore!

983
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:11,630
You might even go to jail!

984
00:40:11,630 --> 00:40:12,560
Do you know that?

985
00:40:15,480 --> 00:40:17,610
I'm trying to protect you, believe...

986
00:40:34,710 --> 00:40:35,510
I'm sorry, it's my fault.

987
00:40:35,510 --> 00:40:37,420
I shouldn't have dragged you into this.

988
00:40:37,420 --> 00:40:39,020
I thought I was being clever.

989
00:40:42,840 --> 00:40:43,700
What about you?

990
00:40:44,360 --> 00:40:45,210
I don't care.

991
00:40:46,770 --> 00:40:47,630
I am the presiding judge,

992
00:40:47,630 --> 00:40:48,650
and a member
of the Adjudication Committee.

993
00:40:48,650 --> 00:40:49,780
I can't escape this.

994
00:40:50,560 --> 00:40:51,230
Now, you need to

995
00:40:51,230 --> 00:40:52,440
handle this properly.

996
00:40:52,440 --> 00:40:53,190
Clear your name.

997
00:40:53,190 --> 00:40:53,670
And immediately

998
00:40:53,670 --> 00:40:55,800
find a way to return to Beijing
with Chen Yizhong.

999
00:40:55,800 --> 00:40:57,600
Don't worry about where I'll be.

1000
00:40:58,410 --> 00:40:58,840
Yu Gaoyuan.

1001
00:40:58,840 --> 00:40:59,610
After all that you've just said,

1002
00:40:59,610 --> 00:41:00,490
are you telling me

1003
00:41:00,490 --> 00:41:02,020
there's nothing you can do?

1004
00:41:02,120 --> 00:41:02,920
Are you just going to let

1005
00:41:02,920 --> 00:41:03,760
an innocent man die?

1006
00:41:03,760 --> 00:41:04,710
You're not going to make any effort,

1007
00:41:04,710 --> 00:41:04,920
are you?

1008
00:41:04,920 --> 00:41:05,670
What can I do?

1009
00:41:05,670 --> 00:41:07,000
You show me a way!

1010
00:41:07,020 --> 00:41:09,550
How do I get past
the Adjudication Committee?

1011
00:41:10,030 --> 00:41:12,000
For over ten years, many times,

1012
00:41:12,000 --> 00:41:12,570
I've wanted to tell you

1013
00:41:12,570 --> 00:41:13,960
that I underestimated you before.

1014
00:41:13,960 --> 00:41:15,150
I misjudged you!

1015
00:41:16,240 --> 00:41:17,280
I've been hoping so badly

1016
00:41:17,280 --> 00:41:19,540
that you would do something remarkable,

1017
00:41:24,120 --> 00:41:25,930
so I could apologize to you once.

1018
00:41:32,150 --> 00:41:34,080
I still want to thank you this time.

1019
00:41:37,630 --> 00:41:38,960
But I can't bring myself

1020
00:41:40,510 --> 00:41:41,320
to say ''I'm sorry''.
